@startuml "Camera Discovery & Pairing"

!theme cerulean
title Camera Discovery & Pairing

actor User
participant "CameraListView" as CLV
participant "CameraListViewModel" as VM
participant "OsmoCameraManager" as Mgr
participant "CBCentralManager" as CB
participant "DJI Camera 1" as Cam1
participant "DJI Camera 2" as Cam2

== BLE Advertising (continuous, independent of app) ==

note over Cam1, Cam2
  DJI cameras advertise BLE continuously when powered on.
  Advertisement includes manufacturer data with DJI signature
  (0xAA 0x08 .. .. 0xFA) and service UUID 0xFFF0.
  **No pairing or user action needed to advertise.**
end note

Cam1 -> CB : BLE advertisement
Cam2 -> CB : BLE advertisement

note right of CB
  iOS caches nearby peripherals.
  Advertisements arrive within
  milliseconds of starting a scan.
end note

== User Initiates Discovery ==

User -> CLV : Tap "+" button
CLV -> VM : showAddCamera()
VM -> Mgr : startScanning()
Mgr -> CB : scanForPeripherals(\n  withServices: [0xFFF0])

CB -> Mgr : didDiscover(cam1,\n  advertisementData, rssi)
CB -> Mgr : didDiscover(cam2,\n  advertisementData, rssi)

note right of Mgr
  Cameras already advertising
  appear almost instantly.
  Filter: isDJICamera() checks
  mfr bytes + RSSI >= -80 dBm
end note

Mgr --> CLV : AddCameraView shows\n  discovered cameras

== User Adds Cameras ==

User -> CLV : Tap camera row\n  (or "Add All")
CLV -> VM : pairCamera(discovered)
VM -> Mgr : addCamera(discovered)

Mgr -> Mgr : Create OsmoCamera(\n  name, peripheralID)
Mgr -> Mgr : persistCameras()\n  (UserDefaults)

VM -> VM : dismissAddCamera()
VM -> Mgr : stopScanning()
Mgr -> CB : stopScan()

Mgr -> Mgr : connect(camera)\n  → see Handshake diagram

@enduml
